[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0307","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0704","title":"1C Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 路径泄露漏洞","description":"1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 的 tradecli.dll 组件存在路径泄露漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过构造包含不存在文件模板参数的 URL 请求，导致应用程序在错误响应中泄露服务器工作目录的完整物理路径。该漏洞影响 1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可获取服务器目录结构信息，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），属于信息泄露类漏洞，攻击者可利用泄露的路径信息进一步发起路径遍历、文件包含等后续攻击。官方已停止维护该版本，建议升级至新版本或迁移至现代电商平台。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0704"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48Z","remediation":"升级到最新的 1C:Enterprise 平台版本，应用最新的安全补丁并更新 tradecli.dll。修改 web 服务器配置，禁用模板参数功能或实现严格的错误处理以防止路径信息泄露。如无法立即更新，可在防火墙中添加规则以拒绝对 tradecli.dll 的访问请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2904","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6738","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20948","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0704.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0704","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0704.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0704.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2pcg-p7wq-33j6/GHSA-2pcg-p7wq-33j6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2904/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0704.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0305","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0305.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0703","title":"1C Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 的 tradecli.dll 组件在处理模板参数时未正确验证 MS-DOS 设备名称（如 COM1、PRN、AUX 等），远程未认证攻击者可构造包含 MS-DOS 设备名称的 URL 请求，导致服务器进程挂起或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 版本，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响可用性（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P）。攻击者只需发送包含类似 COM1、PRN 等设备名的模板参数即可触发拒绝服务，ExploitDB 已公开 PoC（EDB-20949）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0703"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 1C: Arcadia Internet Store 2.0 或更高版本（官方已停止 1.0 版本支持）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含 MS-DOS 设备名（如 COM1、LPT1、AUX、PRN、NUL、CON）的 template 参数请求，或在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 重写规则拦截包含设备名的模板参数请求，同时建议迁移至现代电商平台替代该已停止维护的旧版本产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2905","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6739","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f2f850a48475dab7b1e1b1c322080edeefb8fa2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0703.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0703","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0703.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98bfa0c64da76a68ffd6d214f436c90f142d4964/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0703.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mqh-m7g2-m4gv/GHSA-7mqh-m7g2-m4gv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0703.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5be40f9b-b6e0-4aaf-85cd-13999c1b559d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0304","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0304.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0691","title":"华盛顿大学 imapd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Washington University 开发的 imapd（互联网消息访问协议守护进程）2000a 至 2000c 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理某些输入时未对缓冲区长度进行充分边界检查，导致栈上或堆上的缓冲区可被溢写覆盖。在特定配置下，攻击者作为拥有本地账号但无 shell 访问权限的普通用户，可利用此漏洞在 imapd 进程中执行任意代码，并以自身用户身份获得部分代码执行权限。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 imapd 的各类 Linux/Unix 服务器，CVSS 评分为 4.6（中危），攻击复杂度低，无需额外认证即可触发。成功利用可导致攻击者在服务器上获得进一步的控制能力，建议升级至补丁版本或更高稳定版本以消除安全隐患。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0691"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Washington University imapd 升级至 2000d 或更高版本，以修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。Red Hat 系统可安装 RHSA-2001:094 安全更新，Mandrake 系统可应用 MDKSA-2001:054 补丁。如暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙中限制 IMAP 服务的本地访问，仅允许可信用户连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6269.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-094.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3352","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e532da319bd448554f3195f38b855d2e9be0809/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0691.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0691","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0691.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c38da4de9997eed21b6a4c71c4b194b6f142b8fc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0691.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34d23bc289ec08cf13b2c7e74563dcd9a8c17e9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7vqj-q42p-29c8/GHSA-7vqj-q42p-29c8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0691.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2856/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0691.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6064aaa6-3f6b-44f2-8f4e-a920d391a4b6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0304.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0303","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0702","title":"Cerberus FTP Server 1.x 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cerberus FTP Server 1.5 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 FTP 协议向目标服务器发送超长的用户名、密码或 PASV 命令触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，可能引发拒绝服务甚至远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Cerberus FTP Server 1.x 系列早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需任何身份验证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0702"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47Z","remediation":"建议将 Cerberus FTP Server 升级至厂商最新发布的 2026.x 版本（当前稳定版为 2026.2.2），该版本已修复历史上包括 CVE-2001-0702 在内的所有已知缓冲区溢出漏洞。若运行环境受限于旧版系统无法立即升级，应在边界防火墙或主机防火墙中仅允许可信 IP 段访问 21/TCP 端口，并临时禁用匿名登录；同时在入侵检测系统（IDS）中部署规则，对 FTP 用户名、密码及 PASV 命令携带超过 300 字节超长字符串的连接会话进行拦截告警。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archive.cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2001/07/msg00070.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192655","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2901","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6728","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20946","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4a89b44478cf1ae516da29bd6f16b00a8bec011/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0702.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0702","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0702.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d2521a6a6a6b95fdd6c2651e419302899bbee89/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0702.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/99cae226d61b8e74336dc0c5e362f6c067c34ab5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vwm4-vhxv-9c48/GHSA-vwm4-vhxv-9c48.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0702.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2901/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--387ec1e3-9fdc-436f-b41b-ce57c4ce78fd.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0302","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0701","title":"Sun SunVTS PTExec 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Microsystems 开发的 Sun Validation Test Suite（SunVTS）4.3 及更早版本中，ptexec 工具在处理 -o 命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序未对用户传入的参数长度进行充分的边界检查，攻击者可构造超长字符串作为 -o 参数的值，覆盖栈上的返回地址，从而劫持程序执行流程。该漏洞仅影响具备本地访问权限的用户，攻击者需首先登录到运行 SunVTS 的 Solaris 系统，然后执行 /opt/SUNWvts/bin/ptexec -o 并附带超长载荷即可触发溢出，实现权限提升并可能获得系统的完全管理控制权。Sun Microsystems 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0701"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47Z","remediation":"建议升级 SunVTS 至 5.0 或更高版本，或应用 Sun 安全补丁 112617-01。如暂无法升级，临时措施为将 /opt/SUNWvts/bin/ptexec 权限修改为仅 root 用户可执行（chmod 700），并限制普通用户对 SunVTS 的访问，以消除本地用户利用该缓冲区溢出提权的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192667","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2898","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6736","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20945","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0701.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0701","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0701.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0701.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3chf-9q2g-qc3v/GHSA-3chf-9q2g-qc3v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0701.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7144cb01-a4af-47a3-acb4-f8f9a33bdce5.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0701.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0300","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0700","title":"W3M 0.2.1 及更早版本 MIME 报文头缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>W3M 是一个流行的命令行网页浏览器，其 0.2.1 及更早版本在处理 MIME 邮件头时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当远程攻击者向使用 W3M 的目标发送包含超长 base64 编码 MIME 头的恶意邮件或网页内容时，W3M 解析该头字段时发生缓冲区溢出，可能导致执行任意代码。此漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 W3M 的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程发起利用，造成权限提升、信息泄露或系统被完全控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0700"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47Z","remediation":"立即将 w3m 升级至 0.2.2 或更高版本以修复 MIME 头 base64 缓冲区溢出。Debian 用户应执行 apt-get update && apt-get install w3m 以获取 DSA-064/DSA-081 补丁版本，FreeBSD 用户应安装 FreeBSD-SA-01:46.w3m 安全补丁。如无法立即升级，应临时避免使用 w3m 访问不可信或未知网站，因恶意远程服务器可通过构造超长 base64 编码 MIME 头字段触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码，可通过先使用 curl 等工具下载网页再本地查看代替直接使用 w3m 浏览外部内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000434","http://mi.med.tohoku.ac.jp/~satodai/w3m-dev-en/200106.month/537.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-064","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-081","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192371","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2895","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20941","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe1f2cb931ec10d1e039a6fd54386a966f969658/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0700.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0700","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0700.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e42471f11b569c31aa66236a559376c1c33d96f2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0700.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-064.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a1f79da7d9ace94965a4a6372e679be3d02ffe25/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4h5-5xwp-3m26/GHSA-w4h5-5xwp-3m26.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-081.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--190adffa-b1c7-453f-bfc0-522364d6a31b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0299","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0697","title":"Netwin SurgeFTP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin SurgeFTP 1.0b 至 1.1h 之间存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的 \"ls ..\" 命令触发目标 FTP 服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 SurgeFTP 1.0b、1.0c、1.0d、1.0e、1.0f、1.0g、1.0h 及 1.1g 等版本，攻击者只需建立 FTP 连接并发送目录列表命令即可导致服务器异常终止，造成服务中断。由于攻击通过网络发起且无需任何用户交互，任何可访问 SurgeFTP 服务的远程用户均可利用此漏洞实施拒绝服务攻击。攻击成功后将导致 FTP 进程崩溃或重启，影响正常文件传输业务。建议升级到 SurgeFTP 1.1h 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0697"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47Z","remediation":"标签中。<value>立即将 NetWin SurgeFTP 升级至 1.1h 或更高版本，此版本已修复通过 'ls ..' 命令引发崩溃的漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议通过防火墙或访问控制列表限制外部对 FTP 端口的访问，或在服务器端临时屏蔽 LIST 命令对父目录的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://netwinsite.com/surgeftp/manual/updates.htm","http://www.secadministrator.com/Articles/Index.cfm?ArticleID=20200","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/165816","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2442","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6168","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20659","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/721f5647080ad234b0e7db49f4cb7a1a1f72d604/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0697","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0697.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ffd57c03ae1089460fd6f5c8a0b1d7efb29040a8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0697.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39d8887723797efc1804585dd06585c9fd751226/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vqw8-7vgj-vq9c/GHSA-vqw8-7vgj-vq9c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c273d018-01a6-49bc-aa2f-b90a66e1ae76.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0697.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0299.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0297","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0297.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0693","title":"WebTrends WebTrends HTTP Server 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"WebTrends Enterprise Reporting Server 3.1c 和 3.5 版本的HTTP服务器存在源代码泄露漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在目标URL的文件名后添加URL编码的空格字符（%20），绕过服务器对脚本文件的保护机制，导致服务器以源代码形式而非正常执行后的结果返回脚本文件内容。攻击者借此可直接获取服务器上脚本的敏感信息，包括数据库连接凭据、业务逻辑代码和内部文件路径等机密数据。该漏洞影响 WebTrends Enterprise Reporting Server 3.1c 和 3.5 版本，攻击面覆盖所有将相关服务暴露在网络中的实例。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0693"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46Z","remediation":"建议立即将受影响服务器升级至 WebTrends Enterprise Reporting Server 更高版本，3.1c 和 3.5 均受影响且官方已发布安全修复。如无法立即升级，可在 WebTrends HTTP Server 的配置中对包含 URL 编码空格（%20）的 CGI 请求返回 403 Forbidden 错误以阻止源文件泄露。同时建议在防火墙或反向代理层对所有 CGI 脚本的请求统一过滤 %20 等控制字符，防止攻击者通过构造含编码空格的 URL 读取脚本源代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99166905208903&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2812","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6639","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20895","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10542eebf1e993745def113b14941719ae818f2d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0693.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0693","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0693.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc4d86fa626798689c9cd6668d1881354e44e4cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0693.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6jw9-8f44-h84j/GHSA-6jw9-8f44-h84j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0693.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-41.txt","https://github.com/ws-researcher/CAEA/blob/098ddb07c83845feda3d1b1d56ef634927954af4/KGA/dataSet/ICNS/entN_ids_1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0295","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0690","title":"University of Cambridge Exim 3.x 邮件传输代理格式字符串漏洞","description":"Exim 3.x 邮件传输代理（MTA）在批量 SMTP 模式（-bS）下存在格式字符串漏洞。该漏洞源于 Exim 在处理邮件头部的域名字符串时未正确过滤格式字符串控制符，当管理员启用了语法检查（syntax checking）模式后，远程攻击者可以通过向 From 邮件头中注入格式字符串（如 %p），触发栈上内存信息泄露并进一步覆盖栈帧执行任意代码，最终以 root 权限完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响多种 Linux 发行版所打包的 Exim 3.x 版本，包括 Red Hat 3.22-10、Debian 3.12 及 Conectiva 3.16，利用门槛极低——仅需通过 SMTP 协议发送一封包含特制头部的邮件即可触发，无需身份认证。ExploitDB（EDB-ID: 20900）已公开可利用的本地提权利用代码，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0690"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46Z","remediation":"升级 Exim 至修复版本：Debian 系统升级至 exim 3.12-10.1（DSA-058），Red Hat 系统应用 RHSA-2001-078 安全补丁，Conectiva 系统安装公告 000402 对应更新包。若无法立即升级，可在 exim 配置文件中禁用语法检查模式（syntax checking）及批处理 SMTP 模式（-bS），避免攻击者利用格式字符串漏洞执行任意代码；同时建议限制本地用户对 /usr/sbin/exim 二进制文件的访问权限，仅允许必要的的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0041.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000402","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-058","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-078.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2828","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6671","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20900","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0690.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4a89b44478cf1ae516da29bd6f16b00a8bec011/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0690.json","https://github.com/x0rz/EQGRP/blob/0c2354ff1073099b2aa417030b3167ec29d7279c/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d2521a6a6a6b95fdd6c2651e419302899bbee89/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0690.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-058.nasl","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0690.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/99cae226d61b8e74336dc0c5e362f6c067c34ab5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmjp-jcfp-7jf8/GHSA-wmjp-jcfp-7jf8.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-058.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/divining-risk/blob/286d414a20238d70344afbbc3869527af7cea8e5/data/VulnCheck-KEV.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0293","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0688","title":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 3.0/4.0/4.7/5.x（最高至5.9.5.0版本）的CWD（Change Working Directory）命令处理模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞的原理是FTP服务器在解析CWD或CD命令参数时未对输入进行充分验证，当接收到包含无效\". .\"（点-空格-点）序列的目录路径参数时，会导致缓冲区溢出并触发TSFTPSRV服务进程的访问违规，从而使FTP服务崩溃并中断运行。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本Broker FTP Server的Windows系统，覆盖3.0至5.9.5.0之间的所有版本。攻击条件为攻击者能够在网络层面访问目标FTP服务的21端口，且无需任何身份验证凭据即可发起攻击。利用方式为远程攻击者通过FTP客户端连接到目标服务器后，重复发送参数为\". .\"的CWD或CD命令，持续触发缓冲区溢出，最终导致FTP服务进程崩溃停止响应，必须手动重启服务才能恢复，从而造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞的相关利用代码已在2001年6月通过Bugtraq邮件列表公开，安全研究人员认为缓冲区溢出存在被进一步利用以获取服务器控制权的潜在可能性。TransSoft已发布更新版本修复此问题，管理员应及时升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0688"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 TransSoft Broker FTP Server 至修正了 CWD 缓冲区溢出的修复版本。如无法短期完成升级，应在防火墙中限制 FTP 服务（TCP 21 端口）仅对可信来源开放，关闭匿名登录功能，并在 FTP 服务层面限制单 IP 的连接频率与异常 CWD 命令请求，以防止服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190032","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2851","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20910","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cec5b6a05e11425484ae88e202806353cc4620e6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0688.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0688","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0688.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f5111fc7f0351eb7acd97d5a87fa56872d8a50fd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0688.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/905c759ea25c11a59e5c85d4af57ced286cebb3a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wpp7-4crq-f956/GHSA-wpp7-4crq-f956.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0688.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e626203d-3dd4-483e-adea-41b84c0bae44.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0293.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0292","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0685","title":"Thibault Godouet FCron 1 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"FCron 在 1.1.1 版本之前存在符号链接漏洞，其 fcrontab 命令在处理临时文件时未对临时文件路径进行安全检查。具有本地账户的攻击者可在系统临时目录中预先创建指向其他用户 crontab 文件的符号链接，当该用户执行 fcrontab 编辑操作时， FCron 会错误地将调度配置写入符号链接所指向的其他用户的 crontab 文件中，从而导致其他用户的计划任务配置被篡改或破坏，可实现跨用户的权限提升或服务中断。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0685"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46Z","remediation":"升级 FCron 至 1.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复临时文件符号链接漏洞，引入安全的临时文件创建机制防止被攻击者利用。如暂无法立即升级，可将 fcron 临时文件目录（/var/spool/fcron/）权限设置为仅 fcron 用户可读写，并确保普通用户无法创建指向该目录的符号链接作为临时缓解措施。建议同时检查并恢复可能已遭篡改的用户 crontab 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://fcron.free.fr/CHANGES.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98339581702282&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2835","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7127","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20905","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0685.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0685.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0685","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0685.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0685.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c8mr-fhvj-www3/GHSA-c8mr-fhvj-www3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e95b7758-5b7d-4b8d-874b-4987a6b59327.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0685.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0287","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0287.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0675","title":"Rit Research Labs The Bat! 1.51 邮件客户端 CR/LF 处理拒绝服务漏洞 (CVE-2001-0675)","description":"Rit Research Labs The Bat! 1.51 邮件客户端在处理邮件内容时，未正确处理仅包含回车符 <CR> 而缺少换行符 <LF> 的畸形邮件，导致远程攻击者可通过发送包含单独回车符的特制邮件触发拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞影响 Rit Research Labs The Bat! 1.51 for Windows 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发送恶意邮件触发漏洞，导致邮件客户端拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P)，属于中危级别拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者仅需向目标用户发送包含畸格式行结束符的邮件即可触发拒绝服务，导致邮件客户端崩溃或无法正常处理邮件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0675"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:43Z","remediation":"升级到 The Bat! 4.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了邮件解析的 CR/LF 处理漏洞。或者，从官方网站 https://thebat.net 手动下载并安装 4.0 版。在安装前，可暂时在邮件服务器或客户端策略中禁用不支持 CR/LF 不完整序列的 MIME 解码，或者配置电子邮件服务只接受确以 LF 结尾的邮件。对于 Windows 2000/XP 系统，建议启用安全更新并应用最新的杀毒软件签名数据库以增强保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0345.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0381.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0410.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2636","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6423","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20783","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0675.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0675","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0675.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0675.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2r4r-h566-5q6r/GHSA-2r4r-h566-5q6r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3e15eb83-e210-4d27-ac1c-51144e2bd783.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0675.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0287.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0287.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0287.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0281","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0281.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0653","title":"Sendmail debugger 命令行参数本地缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.10.0 至 8.11.5 以及 8.12.0 beta 版本的调试功能存在输入验证错误。由于 tTflag() 函数使用有符号整数处理带 `-d` 开关的调试参数中的 category 部分，本地攻击者可提供过大的数值触发有符号整数溢出，使其被解释为负数，该值作为 trace vector 的索引可用于在进程内存范围内进行写入操作从而修改进程内存，并可能获取提升的权限。由于 `-d` 命令行参数在程序丢弃提升权限之前处理，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞实现完整的系统沦陷，目前已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0653"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:41Z","remediation":"将 Sendmail 8.10.0 至 8.11.5 及 8.12.0 beta 升级至官方修复版本。如使用 8.11 分支，请升级到 Sendmail 8.11.6；如使用 8.12 分支，请升级到 Sendmail 8.12.1 或更高稳定版。可通过 ftp.sendmail.org 下载对应源码包重新编译安装，或使用系统包管理器（如 yum、apt、FreeBSD ports）更新 sendmail 软件包并重启服务。若暂时无法完成升级，可在 /etc/mail/sendmail.mc 中注释禁用 debugger (-d) 命令行选项的相关配置，重新生成 sendmail.cf 并重启服务，以此限制本地用户使用调试功能，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000412","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-032-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99841063100516&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-106.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-032.0.txt","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-133.shtml","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-075.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_028_sendmail_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3163","http://www.sendmail.org/8.11.html","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBTL0112-007","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7016","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21063","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4b54eaec6e1ac2fa73932c72cc91a932e04af217/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0653","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/4f7816d4f96b3630e6f199beccb961d16e16b19c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0653.md","https://github.com/tomhart-msc/verisec/blob/02f3a9660885181705e7550b8609534bbbaa414c/programs/apps/sendmail/CVE-2001-0653/README","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2a511a3a50683ea9152c5bacd8a2a2e417f6e16/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0653.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32f28e88cd643e53b067fd929c3f6aaf649f3db6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pw59-xvgj-36g7/GHSA-pw59-xvgj-36g7.json","https://github.com/westtide/open-source-case-studies/blob/57e71842cdb3e034316b0d083f8d19f680501b67/verisec/.frama-c/programs_apps_sendmail_CVE-2001-0653_complete_tTflag_ok.eva/warnings.log","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/8608e2acfa2206042eff8a455c82e251a64c277c/packages/cve_diff/data/cves/ALL_OPENSOURCE_CVES_COMPLETE_HISTORICAL.csv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0653.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/sendmail_local_overflow.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0281.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0278","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0278.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0649","title":"Apple Personal Web Sharing 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apple Personal Web Sharing 1.1/1.5/1.5.5 版本存在远程拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过发送超长的 HTTP 请求导致服务拒绝。该漏洞源于 Web 共享服务对超长 HTTP 请求处理不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可发送特制的超长 HTTP 请求触发漏洞，导致服务崩溃或无响应，造成拒绝服务。影响 Apple Personal Web Sharing 1.1、1.5 及 1.5.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向目标服务发送精心构造的超长 HTTP 请求即可触发拒绝服务，无需身份验证。Apple 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至修复版本。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC（EDB-ID: 20844），攻击者可直接利用该 PoC 进行攻击验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0649"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apple Personal Web Sharing 到最新支持的版本（如 2.0 或更高），并停用此服务如果不再需要。如果无法立即升级，可通过修改 httpd.conf 配置文件将 KeepAliveOff 设为 on，并限制 MaxRequestSize 设置为 8192 或更小，以限制 HTTP 请求长度，防止长请求导致服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/184548","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6536","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20844","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0649.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0649","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0649.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0649.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gpqf-2gcw-mwj8/GHSA-gpqf-2gcw-mwj8.json","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/pre2008/PWS_DoS.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0649.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--aa3f9d0b-85ce-4610-b849-296716ead45e.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0278.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0278.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0272","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0643","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 CLSID 文件执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 存在 CLSID 文件执行漏洞，该漏洞源于 IE 5.5 在文件名末尾包含类标识符 (CLSID) 时不会显示该 CLSID，导致攻击者可通过构造包含 CLSID 的文件名（如 document.txt{CLSID}），将可执行程序伪装成安全的文档文件类型，诱导用户点击执行恶意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 版本，攻击者需诱导用户点击恶意链接或打开恶意文件，利用方式为社工欺骗用户执行伪装成安全文档的恶意程序，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响完整性，Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0643"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:40Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Internet Explorer 5.5，升级至 Microsoft Edge、Google Chrome 或 Mozilla Firefox 等现代受支持浏览器。如必须使用 IE，请升级至 IE 11 并安装最新累积安全更新（KB4598298 等）。临时缓解措施：在文件夹选项中取消勾选\"隐藏已知文件类型的扩展名\"，在 Internet 选项-安全-自定义级别中禁用\"未标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件\"和\"对未标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件提示\"，并通过组策略或注册表禁用 CLSID 扩展隐藏功能（HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\CLSID\\{...} 相关键值）。同时加强用户安全意识教育，不打开来历不明的文件附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://vil.nai.com/vil/virusSummary.asp?virus_k=99048","http://www.guninski.com/clsidext.html","http://www.osvdb.org/7858","http://www.sarc.com/avcenter/venc/data/vbs.postcard%40mm.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/176909","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2612","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6426","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0643.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0643","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground